User has reported that their Mail keeps asking for their password, over and over again.
After typing and entering, it works for a minute before asking again, even when typing the correct password.

Troubleshoot the user has already done before contacting Servicedesk:
- Typed my password many times
- Checked caps lock is off

We will have to remote into their Desktop and find the Control Panel.
We will find their Mail client and click the repair button.
This refreshes the connection to the Mail service and it solved the problem.

Ticket solved.
